      "title": "Ericsson eNode-B: Reduce use of static arrays.",
      "message": "Ericsson eNode-B: Reduce use of static arrays.\n\nInstead of statically allocating a 128 kByte line buffer, dynamically allocate\nit and stash it in wtap->priv.\n\nReduces libwiretap's .bss by 128 kBytes.  Also eliminates conflict for that\nstatic buffer if we ever end up concurrently using multiple instances of this\nparser.\n",
